flowchart LR
    Visitor --> CloudFront
    CloudFront --> Website[Processed S3: React files and downloads]
    CloudFront -->|/api/*| API[API Gateway]
    API --> Upload[Upload Lambda]
    API --> Status[Status Lambda]
    Upload --> Jobs[(DynamoDB jobs)]
    Visitor -->|Pre-signed upload| Raw[Raw S3]
    Raw --> Resizer[Resizer Lambda]
    Resizer --> Jobs
    Resizer --> Website
